        "main_text_has_explicit_synthesis": true,
        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "To a stirred solution of precursor [Zn(L)(MeCN)] (127 mg, 0.3 mmol) in absolute MeCN (10 ml) was added a solution of LaCl3·6H2O (106 mg, 0.3 mmol) in absolute MeOH. The mixture was stirred overnight at room temperature. Solid NaN3 (59 mg, 0.9 mmol) was added and stirring was continued at room temperature for 2 h. The pale yellow solution was filtered and diethyl ether was allowed to diffuse slowly into the filtrate at room temperature, giving pale yellow microcrystals of 1 in about three weeks.",
